<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 4.54 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 4.54 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 4.54 percent on Thursday from 4.58 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded on the market in 12 reported transactions with a total value of 17.65 million dinars ($24.9 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
